  "steps": [
    "Marinate the mutton with the curd, half the ginger garlic paste, chilli powder, turmeric, cumin powder and salt for at least 1 hour.",
    "Heat the mustard oil, lightly fry the potatoes until golden and set aside.",
    "In the same oil add the bay leaves, cardamom, cloves and cinnamon, then the onions and sugar and cook until deep brown.",
    "Add the remaining ginger garlic paste and the mutton with its marinade; cook on medium-high for 15 minutes, stirring.",
    "Add the water, cover and cook on low for 40 minutes, adding the potatoes for the last 15 minutes.",
    "Cook uncovered until the gravy turns thick and oil floats on top, then sprinkle the garam masala."
  ]
